# Class: obo:FBbt_00052957 (adult WBI015 neuron of ventral nerve cord)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1101/2023.05.31.542897") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_00052957 "Bilateral neuron of the WBI015 group of the adult ventral nerve cord that primarily arborizes in the wing neuropil (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It is an intersegmental interneuron (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has mixed arborization in the ipsilateral intermediate tectulum of the prothoracic neuromere, wing neuropil and intermediate tectulum of the mesothoracic neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has its soma in a posterior-ventral-lateral position in the prothoracic neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It belongs to the 3B hemilineage of the T1 neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). There are three of these cells per hemineuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023).")
