# Class: obo:FBbt_00052959 (adult WBI017 neuron of ventral nerve cord)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1101/2023.05.31.542897") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_00052959 "Bilateral neuron of the WBI017 group of the adult ventral nerve cord that primarily arborizes in the wing neuropil (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It is an intersegmental interneuron (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has dendritic arborization in the ipsilateral intermediate tectulum of the mesothoracic neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has axonal arborization in the ipsilateral haltere neuropil and the contralateral haltere neuropil (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has mixed arborization in the ipsilateral wing neuropil and the contralateral wing neuropil (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has its soma in a posterior-dorsal-lateral position in the prothoracic neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It belongs to the 11B hemilineage of the T1 neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). There is one of these cells per hemineuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023).")
AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:FBbt_00052959 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705>)
