# Class: obo:FBbt_00052971 (adult WBL008 neuron of ventral nerve cord)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1101/2023.05.31.542897") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_00052971 "Bilateral neuron of the WBL008 group of the adult ventral nerve cord that primarily arborizes in the wing neuropil (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It is an interneuron that arborizes mainly within one neuromere of the VNC (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has mixed arborization in the ipsilateral wing neuropil and the contralateral wing neuropil and intermediate tectulum of the mesothoracic neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has its soma in a posterior-ventral-medial position in the mesothoracic neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It is a primary neuron (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). There is one of these cells per hemineuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023).")
