# Class: obo:FBbt_00052984 (adult WBL021 neuron of ventral nerve cord)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1101/2023.05.31.542897") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_00052984 "Bilateral neuron of the WBL021 group of the adult ventral nerve cord that primarily arborizes in the wing neuropil (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It is an interneuron that arborizes mainly within one neuromere of the VNC (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has mixed arborization in the contralateral wing neuropil (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has its soma in a anterior-ventral-medial position in the mesothoracic neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It belongs to the 6B hemilineage of the T2 neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). There is one of these cells per hemineuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023).")
