# Class: obo:FBbt_00053032 (adult XBI002 neuron of ventral nerve cord)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "doi:10.1101/2023.05.31.542897") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FBbt_00053032 "Bilateral neuron of the XBI002 group of the adult ventral nerve cord that primarily arborizes in the accessory mesothoracic neuropil (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It is an intersegmental interneuron (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has mixed arborization in the lower tectulum of the prothoracic neuromere, accessory mesothoracic neuropil and lower tectulum of the mesothoracic neuromere of both hemispheres (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It has its soma in a anterior-ventral-medial position in the mesothoracic neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). It belongs to the 0A hemilineage of the T2 neuromere (Ehrhardt et al., 2023).")
